OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and some showers
OL,6,Fthrough the day, some turning heavy
OL,7,Fand thundery in the afternoon and
OL,8,Fearly evening. Best of the dry and
OL,9,Fbright weather towards the east coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FClear spells and scattered
OL,12,Fshowers through the evening, some of
OL,13,Fthese heavy. Further mainly light
OL,14,Fshowers overnight with variable cloud
OL,15,Fand clear spells. Breezy around the
OL,16,FMoray and Buchan coasts.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FA few light showers in the
OL,19,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright by
OL,20,Fmidday. A band of heavy rain pushes
OL,21,Feast through the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
