OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright spells and a few showers on
OL,7,FThursday. Showers easing Friday
OL,8,Fmorning, becoming dry and bright, then
OL,9,Ffurther rain in the evening. Bright
OL,10,Fspells Saturday with just the odd
OL,11,Fshower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
